OL,5,G2100 A&E After Dark
OL,6,     FA&E staff tackle night shifts,
OL,7,     Fmanaging severe trauma, violence,
OL,8,     Fand complex cases, including a man
OL,9,     Fwith severed fingers, a farmer
OL,10,     Fwith hand injuries, and a possible
OL,11,     Fheart attack.
OL,12,G2200 Ambulance: Code Red
OL,13,     FA 64-year-old man collapses at
OL,14,     Fwork with a suspected cardiac
OL,15,     Farrest, and paramedics rush to
OL,16,     Fhelp a woman trapped in her car
OL,17,     Fafter crashing into a fallen tree.
