OL,5,G2300 Skin A&E
OL,6,     FDr Emma McMullen operates on a
OL,7,     Fstrange pectoral lipoma.
OL,8,     FForty-three-year-old Tamzin visits
OL,9,     FDr Natalia Spierings who's a
OL,10,     Fspecialist in her skin condition,
OL,11,     Fmelasma.
OL,12,G0000 Britain's Hotel Murders
OL,13,     FThe body of 20-year-old Panashe
OL,14,     FBako lay in the corridor of a
OL,15,     FBirmingham hotel but despite the
OL,16,     Fefforts of paramedics, Bako was
OL,17,     Fpronounced dead at hospital. What
OL,18,     Fled to his tragic demise? (Ep7)
